# Copy to .profile.local, which is gitignored, and fill in with real details.
# In CI this same text goes in the RASID_STUDENT_PROFILE repository secret.
#
# It is kept out of the repository because it is the one file here that
# describes a person. Everything else is about organisations.
#
# The classifier refuses to run without it rather than judging against a blank
# profile, so a missing file is a loud failure, never a quiet wrong answer.

- Final-year <degree> student, <university>
- GPA <x.xx>/4
- <certifications, if any>
- <graduation project, if it is relevant to the roles you want>
- NOT yet graduated — he is INELIGIBLE for HRDF "تطوير الخريجين / تمهير",
  which requires the final degree document in hand
- He needs "التدريب التعاوني" (cooperative training) specifically
- He will have <n> evening lecture courses (<from>–<to>) plus a supervised
  graduation-project course registered during the training semester
